From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eduardo Ruiz <335073+eduarbo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:29:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Let a theme give the save states' tiles images and icons

The save state sheet filled its selected tile with the selector's
colour and drew the others with no container at all, and its new
game and new autosave tiles had the same icon.

A menuTile element gives the tiles a background and a selected
background, drawn as they are, with 8 pixels between tiles; the
menuIcons iconNewGame and iconAutoSave give those two tiles their
own icons. Without them the sheet is unchanged.
---
